title: "Evidence-Aware Compositional RV for ISR Swarms: reproduction repository"
abstract: >-
  Monitors, mission generator, fault injection, experiment drivers, realism
  layers, browser console and archived LLM runs for three-layer compositional
  runtime verification of LLM-assisted ISR swarms over an evidence-aware fabric.
